### 获取可用配送服务（getEligibleShipmentServices）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/merchant-fulfillment/operations/getEligibleShipmentServices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"shipmentRequestDetails":{"amazonOrderId":"114-1234567-1234567","itemList":[]}}}

### 查询货件（getShipment）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/merchant-fulfillment/operations/getShipment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"shipmentId":"Dg1234567890"}}

### 取消货件（cancelShipment）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/merchant-fulfillment/operations/cancelShipment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"shipmentId":"Dg1234567890"}}

### 创建货件（createShipment）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/merchant-fulfillment/operations/createShipment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"shipmentRequestDetails":{"amazonOrderId":"114-1234567-1234567","itemList":[]}}}

### 获取附加卖家输入（getAdditionalSellerInputs）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/merchant-fulfillment/operations/getAdditionalSellerInputs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"shippingServiceId":"SERVICE-ID","shipmentRequestDetails":{"amazonOrderId":"114-1234567-1234567","itemList":[]}}}
